{"articleNo":"93439","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=93439&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[10.17~21]2013학년도 겨울계절학기 타대학(경북대,충북대) 수학안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.10.15","hit":"5511","attachments":[{"name":"타대학수학신청원(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=93439&attachNo=3137"},{"name":"2013 겨울계절학기 경북대학교 수학 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=93439&attachNo=3139"},{"name":"2013 겨울계절학기 충북대학교 수학 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=93439&attachNo=3184"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013학년도 겨울계절학기&nbsp;타대학(경북대,충북대) 수학안내</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 지원자격 : 아래의 각 호에 해당하는 자(아래 가,나,다 모두 충족하여야 함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 재학생으로서 2개 학기 이상 이수한 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균이 3.0 이상인 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자(학사경고 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 수학기간 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 경북대 : 2013. 12. 23.(월) ~ 2014. 1. 22.(수)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">[수업에 따라 다르므로 첨부파일 반드시 확인]</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 충북대 : 2013. 12. 23.(월) ~ 2014. 1. 19.(일)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 신청학점 및 등록금 : <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><u><font color=\"#980000\">★ 수강신청 기간에 본인이 직접 수강신청 함</font></u></strong></span> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 경북대 : 6학점 이내&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">/ 학점당 25,000원(실험실습강좌 및 초중급교양영어 학점당 30,000원)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 충북대 : 6학점 이내&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">/ 학점당 20,000원(실험실기과목 22,000원)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 신청서 제출 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">소속 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 10. 17.(목) ~ 10. 21.(월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 타대학수학신청원(첨부파일) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 성적증명서</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 기타 자세한 사항은 2013학년도 겨울계절학기 경북대,충북대학교 수학 안내(첨부파일) 참고 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">선수과목 이수여부를 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">한 후 신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(재수강 불가)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">8. 문의전화 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">각 학부(과) 종합학사행정실 전화번호</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: